s="relative z-10 block font-semibold text-gray-900">Blogs</span></a><a class="group relative block rounded-[22px] px-3.5 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-200" style="transition-delay:0ms;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-10px)" href="/app-store"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[22px] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 group-active:opacity-100" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.48)"></div><span class="relative z-10 block font-semibold text-gray-900">App Store</span></a><a href="https://partners.dub.co/voice-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative block rounded-[22px] px-3.5 py-2.5 transition-colors duration-200" style="transition-delay:0ms;opacity:0;transform:translateX(-10px)"><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[22px] opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 group-active:opacity-100" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.48)"></div><span class="relative z-10 block font-semibold text-gray-900">Affiliates</span></a></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-6 right-6 h-px pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(15,23,42,0.06), transparent)"></div></div></div></div></nav><div class="relative px-4 pb-24 pt-32 md:px-6 md:pt-40"><article class="relative z-[2] mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="mk-reveal  "><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-400 transition-colors hover:text-gray-900" href="/app-store"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span>All integrations</a></div><div class="mk-reveal  " style="--mk-delay:40ms"><header class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><img src="/icons/integrations/outlook.webp" alt="Outlook logo" width="112" height="112" class="mk-icon h-24 w-24 md:h-28 md:w-28" style="filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08))"/><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><h1 class="section-title text-gray-950" style="font-size:clamp(2rem, 4.6vw, 3rem);font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em">Outlook</h1></div><p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-[17px] font-light leading-7 text-gray-600 md:text-[19px]">Email, calendar, and contacts in Microsoft 365</p></div></div><div class="glassmorphic-button-wrap flex-none"><a class="glassmorphic-button is-primary" href="/"><span class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap">Download VoiceOS</span></a><div class="glassmorphic-button-shadow"></div></div></header></div><div class="mk-reveal  " style="--mk-delay:90ms"><div class="mt-12"><div class="mk-strip" role="list"><div role="listitem" class="mk-strip-cell"><p class="mk-strip-label">Version</p><p class="mk-strip-value">1.0.0</p><p class="mk-strip-caption">Built in</p></div><div role="listitem" class="mk-strip-cell"><p class="mk-strip-label">Developer</p><p class="mk-strip-value">VoiceOS</p><p class="mk-strip-caption">First-party</p></div><div role="listitem" class="mk-strip-cell"><p class="mk-strip-label">Tools</p><p class="mk-strip-value">11</p><p class="mk-strip-caption">voice actions</p></div><div role="listitem" class="mk-strip-cell"><p class="mk-strip-label">Category</p><p class="mk-strip-value">Email</p></div><div role="listitem" class="mk-strip-cell"><p class="mk-strip-label">Platforms</p><p class="mk-strip-value">macOS · Windows</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mk-reveal  " style="--mk-delay:120ms"><section class="mt-14"><h2 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-400">Try saying</h2><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><span class="mk-say-chip max-w-full"><span class="mk-say-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="min-w-0">“<!-- -->Send the proposal to procurement<!-- -->”</span></span><span class="mk-say-chip max-w-full"><span class="mk-say-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="min-w-0">“<!-- -->What’s on my Outlook calendar on Friday?<!-- -->”</span></span></div></section></div><div class="mk-reveal  " style="--mk-delay:140ms"><section class="mt-14"><h2 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-400">Getting started</h2><div class="lp-glass-panel mt-4 p-7 md:p-9"><ol class="grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="mk-step-number">1</span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Download VoiceOS</span><span class="mt-1 block text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Free to start, on Mac and Windows.</span></span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="mk-step-number">2</span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Connect Outlook</span><span class="mt-1 block text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600">One click in the dashboard&#x27;s Integrations tab.</span></span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="mk-step-number">3</span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Just say it</span><span class="mt-1 block text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Speak — VoiceOS does the rest.</span></span></li></ol><div class="mt-8 space-y-2.5 border-t border-black/[0.06] pt-6"><p class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-none text-gray-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>Connects to your Outlook account — you sign in with Outlook in your browser, and VoiceOS never sees your password.</p><p class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600"><svg class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 flex-none text-gray-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>VoiceOS asks you to confirm before it sends, changes, or deletes anything — every action marked “Asks first” below.</p></div></div></section></div><div class="mk-reveal  " style="--mk-delay:160ms"><section class="mt-14"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-400">What it can do</h2><p class="text-[13px] font-light text-gray-400">What Agent Mode can do with this integration.</p></div><div class="mt-4 rounded-[32px] border border-[#f0f0f0] bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.03),0_10px_30px_-18px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] md:p-9"><ul class="grid gap-x-12 gap-y-7 md:grid-cols-2"><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Send an email</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Compose and send a new message from your account.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Reply to an email</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Answer a message without leaving the thread.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Draft an email</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Write a new draft, or a draft reply, for you to review.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Read and search mail</p></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">List, search, and open messages in your mailbox.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Move an email</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">File it into another folder — deleting means Deleted Items.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Create a calendar event</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Add an event with a time and attendees.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Update a calendar event</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Change the time, the title, or the attendees.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Delete a calendar event</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Take an event off the calendar.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">See your schedule</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Read your calendar and check when you&#x27;re free.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Create a contact</p><span class="mk-asks-pill" title="VoiceOS confirms with you before this runs."><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Asks first</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Save someone new to your contacts.</p></li><li><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-gray-950">Look up contacts</p></div><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">Find someone&#x27;s details in your contacts.</p></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="mk-reveal  " style="--mk-delay:80ms"><section class="mt-20"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><h2 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-400">More from the App Store</h2><a class="text-[13px] font-medium text-gray-400 transition-colors hover:text-gray-900" href="/app-store">All integrations</a></div><div class="mt-4 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><a class="mk-card group h-full" aria-label="Apple Mail" href="/app-store/apple-mail"><span class="mk-card-shine" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col"><span class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><img src="/icons/integrations/apple-mail.webp" alt="Apple Mail logo" width="56" height="56" loading="lazy" class="mk-icon h-14 w-14"/><